# Docs: internal launch assets, icon packs, slide carousels, working notes.
# Ignore the folder's contents but keep architecture.md, which the README
# links to. (Ignore children with docs/* - not docs/ - so git still descends
# into the folder and honours the negation below.)
docs/*
!docs/architecture.md

# Docker compose local overrides
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.override.yaml
